1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,752
In time t, a charge I t moves through a potential difference V.

2
00:00:04,752 --> 00:00:08,697
The work done on it is V I t, and all of it becomes heat.

3
00:00:08,697 --> 00:00:15,013
Using V equals I R, the heat is I squared R t, or V squared t over R.

4
00:00:15,013 --> 00:00:20,390
And the rate of heating, the power, is I squared R, or V squared over R.

5
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:21,927
This is Joule's law.

